+| Address | Decoded | What it detects |
+|---|---|---|
+| `0x15db5` | `/proc/self/maps` | the file to scan |
+| `0x16336` | `rwxp` | **writable+executable mappings** ⇒ runtime code injection / JIT-based hookers |
