+
+| Step | Result | Length |
+|---|---|---|
+| as stored | the blob above | 120 ch |
+| Base64-decode ×1 | `ZDg0NTU5MWUwODYwMzNhOTAzNWZkNmI2NmMzYzNkNzNhYTMzYWY5MDc5NGQ2Yjk4NmU2NDc3OWVlYTZiZWM1ZQ==` | 88 ch |
