+```
+  ECB block-equality leak  #85('A'*32) = 3bfd04cc0d7ed55358e2cbe19de21383
+                                       3bfd04cc0d7ed55358e2cbe19de21383
+                                       377222e061a924c591cd9c27ea163ed4
