+```
+      slot[0] @0x81eff78 after func#157 = 310000000000000020000000000000004000201000000000
+      slot[1] @0x81eff60 after func#157 = 78ff1e0800000000 30326547466c566d52 00000000000000
+                                                     └── "02eGFlVmR" — the tail of
+                                                          "WMVEwVG|02eGFlVmR"
