+ *   3. calibrate() rebuilds all 22 RegisterNatives slots. The table at
+ *      0x1b6198 is ZERO in the file and is filled by 66 R_AARCH64_RELATIVE
+ *      relocations, so this only passes if the offsets, the relocation
