++| `q.b()` | `x0012f5b7` | backend User-Agent |
++| `q.c(String)` | `x00105e9b` | `captcha_stamp` (captcha token signer) |
++| `q.d()` | `x0016d3b9` | ServerCheck endpoint path |
++| `q.e()` | `x0014e2e9` | response host/path verifier |
