++<dt>Size</dt><dd>10,379,650 bytes (9.90 MiB)</dd>
++<dt>MD5</dt><dd><code>662029d6c75ea6afa195a7ad4805310c</code></dd>
++<dt>SHA-1</dt><dd><code>b5334408fa4fa671094e585a8cab3f586be92ca1</code></dd>
