++    <div class="fixcol"><h4>Remediation</h4><p>Validate the supplied public key: enforce a minimum modulus size, require RSA, and compare its fingerprint against a pinned allow-list or a signed key-distribution channel. Reject the login rather than sealing to an unexpected key.</p></div>
