++    <div class="fixcol"><h4>Remediation</h4><p>Treat detection as telemetry for server-side risk scoring rather than as a gate. If native detection is retained, add checks that cannot be satisfied by sanitising a file read &mdash; hardware attestation verified server-side is the only construction that holds.</p></div>
