++    <div><h4>How it works</h4><p><code>CaptchaRequest</code> chooses between reCAPTCHA (<code>captcha_type == 0</code>) and hCaptcha, obtaining the site key from native <code>helper.q.f()</code> (<code>x0010e27f</code>) and <code>helper.q.g()</code> (<code>x00113f7a</code>). On success the token goes to <code>verifyCaptcha()</code>, which signs it with native <code>helper.q.c(token)</code> (<code>x00105e9b</code>) and sends <code>captcha_stamp</code> to <code>account/checkCaptcha.php</code>. The SDK fallback site key <code>10000000-ffff-ffff-ffff-000000000001</code> is present in the embedded template.</p></div>
